hamcall-db — NOTICE
===================

This project (hamcall-db) builds a single, normalized amateur-radio callsign
dataset by aggregating data from several upstream sources, each published under
its own license. This NOTICE lists every upstream source, its license, and the
attribution it requires.

The licenses in play cover different things:

  * BUILD CODE — the Python build pipeline in this repository — is licensed
    under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

  * PUBLISHED DATASET — the Parquet artifacts released from this project
    (hamcall-db-YYYY-MM-DD.parquet and hamcall-db-history-YYYY-MM-DD.parquet),
    the SQLite .db, and the POTA parks / park-grid tables — is a combined/derived
    work of the upstream sources below, released under CC BY-NC 4.0. It is
    distributed under the UNION of all upstream source terms. To redistribute
    the dataset you must satisfy every attribution-required license listed here
    simultaneously.

  * OSM PARK GRIDS (source 8) are a separate ODbL release (see LICENSE-ODbL),
    published only when there are OSM-derived rows.

  * REFLECTOR DIRECTORY (sources 11-14) is a separate dataset under CC BY 4.0
    for this project's contributions and DVRef-sourced rows, with per-row
    licence labels (see LICENSE-CC-BY and the section after source 14).

